欢迎回到《Tow 4 Drives》。
Welcome back to Tow 4 Drives.

3
00:00:06,484 --> 00:00:09,653
今天我在威斯康星州的Road America赛道。
Where today you join me in Wisconsin at Road America.

4
00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:12,060
参加2026年MAMA春季拉力赛。
At the 2026 MAMA Spring Rally.

5
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:15,960
MAMA全称是中西部汽车媒体协会。
MAMA, meaning Midwest Automotive Media Association.

6
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:18,510
今天的视频形式有点特别。
Where it's a bit of an untraditional video today.

7
00:00:18,510 --> 00:00:21,957
因为《Tow 4 Drives》通常会让一辆车陪伴我整整一周。
Because at Tow 4 Drives usually I live with the car for an entire week.

8
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:22,705
我们进行日常通勤测试。
We run a commute.

9
00:00:22,705 --> 00:00:24,195
或者展示长期使用的真实体验。
Or we show you what it's like to live with.

10
00:00:24,195 --> 00:00:26,560
再或者来场公路旅行之类的。
Or we go on a road trip or something like that.

11
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:28,948
但今天我有个非常特别的机会
But today I have a very special opportunity

12
00:00:28,948 --> 00:00:35,275
可以带大家抢先体验全新第八代雷克萨斯ES的初印象
to give you some first driving impressions on the brand new 8th generation Lexus ES

13
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:38,127
这款是500e版本，也就是纯电动车
This one's a 500e, meaning it's fully electric

14
00:00:38,127 --> 00:00:42,680
这在雷克萨斯ES历史上还是首次采用电动化动力
which is the first time that the Lexus ES has ever been an EV

15
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:44,000
所以我特别期待想看看它表现如何
So I'm excited to see what this is like

16
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:47,449
说实话我开过来总共才不到半英里
I've literally driven it I think 0.2 of a mile over to this parking lot

17
00:00:47,449 --> 00:00:49,960
所以这绝对是实打实的初印象分享
so these will genuinely be my first impressions

18
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:52,168
这也是我第一次见到实车
and this is also my first time seeing this car

19
00:00:52,168 --> 00:00:54,620
对它的了解其实相当有限
so I really don't know a whole lot about it

20
00:00:54,620 --> 00:00:57,880
但我已经尽力背下了一些参数供参考
but I have tried my best to memorize some specs for you

21
00:00:57,880 --> 00:01:03,870
雷克萨斯ES是电动车系列中次顶配或顶配的动力系统级别。
The Lexus ES is the second level up or the top powertrain trim for the EV.

22
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:05,835
先有350型号，再有500型号。
There's a 350, then there's a 500.

23
00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:08,796
雷克萨斯也会向您销售第八代ES的混动版本。
Lexus will also sell you a hybrid 8th generation ES.

24
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:09,800
但当前这款并非混动。
This is not that.

25
00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:13,912
它搭载双电机系统，拥有338马力。
So this has dual electric motors with 338 horsepower.

26
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:19,125
配备75千瓦时电池组，续航里程约276英里。
It has a 75 kilowatt hour battery, and it has about 276 miles of range.

27
00:01:19,125 --> 00:01:20,969
每当我看到276这个数字，
Which, whenever I think of 276,

28
00:01:20,969 --> 00:01:24,849
总会联想到日本90年代那场著名的“君子协定”。
I always think about the gentleman's agreement in Japan back in the 90s.

29
00:01:24,860 --> 00:01:26,876
但这就是它现在的模样。
But this is what this is now.

30
00:01:26,880 --> 00:01:30,244
信息量有点大，毕竟雷克萨斯ES这款车已经历了漫长岁月。
This is kind of a lot to take in because the Lexus ES it's been around forever.

31
00:01:30,260 --> 00:01:31,844
这是一款非常经典的车。
It's a very iconic car.

32
00:01:31,844 --> 00:01:37,140
现在再看它的设计，确实有很多精心设计的细节，造型非常丰富。
And seeing it now, very much designed, there's a lot of styling going on with this here.

33
00:01:37,140 --> 00:01:39,033
希望我们也能弄一辆回国。
And hopefully we'll have one of these back at home.

34
00:01:39,033 --> 00:01:41,480
那样就能更深入地研究它了。
So we can dive a bit deeper into it.

35
00:01:41,480 --> 00:01:44,920
不过还是先很兴奋地为大家带来今天的首批驾驶感受。
But again, just excited to give you guys some first driving impressions today.

36
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:46,000
这是一款高端车型。
So this is a premium.

37
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:47,170
这些是不同的配置级别。
These are the trim levels.

38
00:01:47,170 --> 00:01:49,315
我还有点没完全搞清楚。
I'm a little bit confused on them still.

39
00:01:49,315 --> 00:01:52,340
但这是顶配发动机的入门版。
But this is the base trim of the top motor.

40
00:01:52,340 --> 00:01:54,220
所以起售价是5万英镑。
So this starts at 50 grand.

41
00:01:54,220 --> 00:01:57,510
这款车型采用超音速白色车漆，搭配纯白内饰。
It's finished in Ultra White with a white interior.

42
00:01:57,510 --> 00:02:00,490
售价约合5.6万美元。
Priced at about $56,000.

43
00:02:00,490 --> 00:02:07,023
但我现在理解到，随着雷克萨斯LS退出产品线，
But what I'm understanding now is that since the Lexus LS is now gone from the lineup.

44
00:02:07,030 --> 00:02:09,505
它并不能完全填补LS的空缺。
This doesn't completely take its spot.

45
00:02:09,505 --> 00:02:12,530
但设计风格确实更偏向LS的方向。
But it kind of leans more towards that side.

46
00:02:12,530 --> 00:02:15,169
显然，ES系列一直都是豪华轿车。
Obviously, the ES has always been a luxury car.

47
00:02:15,170 --> 00:02:19,517
比起运动取向的IS，ES始终更侧重豪华定位。
It's always leaned more towards luxury than the IS, which is kind of the sports sedan.

48
00:02:19,517 --> 00:02:24,080
如今LS停产，这种豪华特质更加凸显。
But even more emphasis on that now because the LS is no more.

49
00:02:24,090 --> 00:02:25,874
正如我们所说，这是一款纯电车型。
So as we said, this is an EV.

50
00:02:25,874 --> 00:02:29,442
其续航里程达276英里，这点我们先前已提及。
It's got 276 miles of range, we already talked about that.

51
00:02:29,442 --> 00:02:32,350
但充电口在上边这儿。
But this is the charge port up here.

52
00:02:32,350 --> 00:02:40,970
还有NAX接口，这肯定是新一代车型的标准配置了。
And this has the NAX port so that is standard of course for this new generation.

53
00:02:40,970 --> 00:02:43,267
这个机构设计得挺有意思的。
Interesting sort of mechanism there for this.

54
00:02:43,267 --> 00:02:45,371
再看这边的大轮毂。
And then we've got these big wheels.

55
00:02:45,371 --> 00:02:49,205
上面还带些能拆卸的小箭头装饰盖。
With some additional little arrow covers here that you could snap on and off.

56
00:02:49,205 --> 00:02:52,287
不过一切都是为了提升能效和续航。
But all in the name of efficiency and range.

57
00:02:52,290 --> 00:02:55,513
前轮是235/45R21规格。
This is a 235/45R21 on the front.

58
00:02:55,513 --> 00:02:58,443
后轮同样是235/45R21。
And on the back the same 235/45R21.

59
00:02:58,450 --> 00:03:00,386
所以是前后同宽的设定。
So a squared setup on this.

60
00:03:00,386 --> 00:03:05,499
周围这些设计元素让我一眼就认出这是雷克萨斯。
And there are styling cues around this that do tell me that it is a Lexus.

61
00:03:05,500 --> 00:03:11,245
整体来看，这东西简直像全新的。
For the most part, this thing just looks brand new.

62
00:03:11,250 --> 00:03:13,805
巨大的后备厢，看起来全新，因为它本来就是新的。
Massive trunk, it looks brand new because it is.

63
00:03:13,810 --> 00:03:16,850
巨大的后备厢，我给这车拍评测前就是这样准备的。
Massive trunk, me when I have it prepared for a car review.

64
00:03:16,850 --> 00:03:19,570
今天可是素颜版本的我哦。
You guys are seeing the raw version of me today.

65
00:03:19,570 --> 00:03:21,150
我把背包放在了后备厢里。
I've got my backpack here in the trunk.

66
00:03:21,150 --> 00:03:23,046
旁边还有看起来像充电线的东西。
Along with what looks like the charging cable.

67
00:03:23,050 --> 00:03:26,746
我们备了急救包和其他杂物。
We've got a first aid kit and some other stuff.

68
00:03:26,746 --> 00:03:29,650
再往底下看，就什么也没有了。
And then underneath here we have nothing.

69
00:03:29,650 --> 00:03:32,972
这个小泡沫垫能提供一点额外储物空间，但仅此而已。
There's a little bit of extra storage with this little foam insert, but that is it.

70
00:03:32,972 --> 00:03:35,690
不过这后备厢是真的大，对电动车来说尤其如此。
But this is a seriously big trunk, especially for an EV.

71
00:03:35,690 --> 00:03:38,600
可能是因为下面有电池和其它部件吧。
I guess when you have batteries and things underneath.

72
00:03:38,600 --> 00:03:40,805
能看到一个宽敞的空间真不错。
It's nice to see a big open space.

73
00:03:40,805 --> 00:03:43,010
用来放高尔夫球杆。
For golf clubs.

74
00:03:43,010 --> 00:03:45,170
因为它们能放进去。
Because they will go in.

75
00:03:45,170 --> 00:03:46,927
好，我们来看看后排座位。
Okay, let's check out the back seat.

76
00:03:46,930 --> 00:03:50,942
这些门把手是电子的；你只需伸手进去就能打开。
These door handles are electronic; you just reach in and open them.

77
00:03:50,942 --> 00:03:55,120
但和新款Highlander一样，我们在外部也有这些手动释放装置。
But like the new Highlander, we have these manual releases on the outside as well.

78
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:58,400
以防那些电子门把手失灵。
In case those electronic door handles fail.

79
00:03:58,400 --> 00:04:00,808
内饰方面，我跟大家说过这是白色的。
On the inside, told you guys this has the white interior.

80
00:04:00,808 --> 00:04:05,664
而且因为这是高配版，我们没有那种夸张的电动后排座椅。
And since this is the premium, we don't have the crazy power back seats.

81
00:04:05,664 --> 00:04:07,765
就像身处豪车里一样。
Like you get in the luxury.

82
00:04:07,765 --> 00:04:11,219
但回到这里依然相当舒适。
But it is still a decent place to be back here.

83
00:04:11,219 --> 00:04:14,164
我一米八的身高坐在自己身后，腿部空间非常宽敞。
At five foot eleven, sat behind myself, I've just got loads of room.

84
00:04:14,180 --> 00:04:17,030
而且座椅确实有些向后倾斜的设计。
And you do kind of sit a little bit leaned back in this.

85
00:04:17,030 --> 00:04:18,550
完全符合豪华轿车的定位。
Like a proper luxury sedan.

86
00:04:18,550 --> 00:04:19,700
这点我们也非常欣赏。
So we love to see that too.

87
00:04:19,700 --> 00:04:21,780
除此之外，后排没有太多花哨配置。
Otherwise, back here, not a whole lot going on.

88
00:04:21,780 --> 00:04:24,653
配备了几个USB-C接口和空调出风口。
There's a couple USB-C ports, some climate vents.

89
00:04:24,653 --> 00:04:27,646
还有可折叠的扶手，带杯托功能。
You've got a fold-down armrest with some cup holders.

90
00:04:27,660 --> 00:04:29,823
杯托从这里弹出——猜得没错吧。
That pop out from there, lucky guess.

91
00:04:29,823 --> 00:04:32,418
然后我一开始以为这是个中控台。
And then I thought maybe this was a console.

92
00:04:32,418 --> 00:04:33,685
但现在我觉得不是。
But now I'm thinking it's not.

93
00:04:33,685 --> 00:04:38,165
我觉得这只是个特别大的扶手，上面还有放手机的位置。
I think it's just a really big armrest, and you've got a spot for a phone right there.

94
00:04:38,165 --> 00:04:41,176
希望以后我也能开上高配版。
Hopefully, someday I can drive the luxury trim too.

95
00:04:41,176 --> 00:04:43,439
因为那才是我真正期待的。
Because that's what I'm really looking forward to.

96
00:04:43,439 --> 00:04:46,483
黑色顶棚，我觉得和白色内饰对比起来很搭。
Black headliner, I think that contrasts nicely with this white interior.

97
00:04:46,483 --> 00:04:49,351
这里还有一段传动轴通道隆起。
And then you have a little drivetrain hump in here as well.

98
00:04:49,351 --> 00:04:52,671
不过我觉得坐中间应该还是没问题。
But I think you could probably still sit in the middle.

99
00:04:52,671 --> 00:04:55,737
好吧，我坐中间的时候头顶确实会碰到天花板。
Okay, my head does touch the ceiling here in the middle.

100
00:04:55,740 --> 00:04:58,511
所以这车可能更适合当四座车用。
So maybe treat this as a bit of a four-passenger setup.

101
00:04:58,511 --> 00:05:03,547
但你确实能深陷进后排座椅里，而且质感真的非常舒服。
But you do seriously sink down into these back seats and they do feel really nice.

102
00:05:03,547 --> 00:05:07,654
车门按钮采用了雷克萨斯NX和RX系列的风格设计。
Got the Lexus NX and RX style door buttons to get out.

103
00:05:07,654 --> 00:05:10,324
当然，这些按钮也兼顾手动解锁功能。
But of course these act as a manual release as well.

104
00:05:10,324 --> 00:05:13,015
拉两次就能从车内开门离开。
You pull those twice and you can get yourself out.

105
00:05:13,015 --> 00:05:16,027
比如在电池没电之类的情况下。
If the battery is dead or something like that.

106
00:05:16,027 --> 00:05:19,632
现在我们要一起确认这辆车到底有没有前备箱。
Now we're gonna find out together if this has a frunk or not.

107
00:05:19,632 --> 00:05:21,344
因为我还没打开过这个地方。
Because I have not opened this yet.

108
00:05:21,344 --> 00:05:23,955
那我们直接看看实际情况吧。
So let's go ahead and find out and see.

109
00:05:23,955 --> 00:05:29,618
虽然不抱太大希望，但这毕竟是一辆五万六千美元的豪车，说不定真有呢。
Not holding my breath but hey it's a 56,000 luxury car so maybe it does.

110
00:05:29,618 --> 00:05:31,083
我倾向于认为没有。
I'm gonna lean towards no.

111
00:05:31,083 --> 00:05:33,594
底下就一大块塑料板。
It's just a big piece of plastic under here.

112
00:05:33,594 --> 00:05:36,780
但至少不是完全裸露的。
But at least it doesn't just have everything exposed.

113
00:05:36,780 --> 00:05:38,652
我可不想乱动这些。
I don't want to mess with this.

114
00:05:38,652 --> 00:05:41,131
因为今天还有好多人要试驾这台车。
Because many other people have to drive it today.

115
00:05:41,131 --> 00:05:42,258
所以我觉得就这样吧。
So I guess that's it.

116
00:05:42,258 --> 00:05:45,458
新款雷克萨斯ES电动车的引擎舱内容就这些了。
That's all you get under the hood of the new electric Lexus ES.

117
00:05:45,458 --> 00:05:47,631
我也很期待体验混动版。
Excited to experience the hybrid too.

118
00:05:47,631 --> 00:05:50,110
不过今天我们选的是纯电版本。
But this is our choice for today, the EV now.

119
00:05:50,110 --> 00:05:53,150
好了，现在得说说明显的问题了。
Okay, all right now, we have to get an elephant out of the room.

120
00:05:53,150 --> 00:06:00,465
大家看到官方新闻稿和照片时第一反应是什么？
Of course, what was everyone's initial reaction when they saw the press release and all of the photos?

121
00:06:00,465 --> 00:06:03,088
当雷克萨斯宣布推出新款ES时。
When they announced this new Lexus ES.

122
00:06:03,088 --> 00:06:06,773
这个嘛，内饰的变化主要体现在全新的仪表盘显示器上。
Well, that was of course the entire new dashboard display.

123
00:06:06,773 --> 00:06:09,506
它取消了很多实体控制按键。
Which got rid of a lot of the physical controls.

124
00:06:09,506 --> 00:06:14,588
现在，如果你刚开始接触这种风格，我并不太喜欢这样的设计。
Now, if you're new to tow for drives, I'm not the biggest fan of this sort of setup.

125
00:06:14,588 --> 00:06:18,282
不过，看到我们仍然保留了音量旋钮，我还是松了口气。
However, I am relieved to see that we still have a volume knob.

126
00:06:18,282 --> 00:06:20,710
空调系统也依然采用独立的实体控制区。
We still have standalone controls for climate.

127
00:06:20,710 --> 00:06:22,670
危险警示灯开关位于中央位置。
We have our hazard switch here in the middle.

128
00:06:22,670 --> 00:06:24,530
甚至连座椅记忆功能键也都保留了下来。
And we even have our little memory seat controls.

129
00:06:24,540 --> 00:06:25,260
就在左侧这里。
Over here on the left.

130
00:06:25,260 --> 00:06:26,844
那么，我们现在启动车辆看看。
So, let's go ahead and start this up.

131
00:06:26,844 --> 00:06:28,587
我们会继续讨论一下。
And we'll talk about it some more.

132
00:06:28,587 --> 00:06:40,327
你可以看到这辆ES 500 e充满电到100%，显示续航270英里。
You can see this ES 500 e charged up to 100 showing 270 miles of range.

133
00:06:40,327 --> 00:06:46,526
在这个非常有趣的悬浮式仪表盘上，后面是Alcantara材质。
On this very interesting floating gauge cluster with Alcantara behind it.

134
00:06:46,526 --> 00:06:49,703
老实说，这看起来很酷。
That's cool to see, I'll be honest.

135
00:06:49,703 --> 00:06:55,082
这就是汽车照片初次发布时的情况。
And this is the way things go when photos are released initially of cars.

136
00:06:55,082 --> 00:06:57,366
照片里的样子总是显得更差一些。
They always do seem worse in the photographs.

137
00:06:57,366 --> 00:06:59,684
而实际内部的感觉其实相当不错。
And this does actually feel pretty decent inside.

138
00:06:59,684 --> 00:07:04,028
显然，我希望这里有一个更独立的空调控制单元。
Obviously, I would like to have a more standalone climate control unit in here.

139
00:07:04,028 --> 00:07:05,744
但这很有趣。
But this is interesting.

140
00:07:05,744 --> 00:07:07,746
我以前从未见过这个。
I've never seen this before.

141
00:07:07,746 --> 00:07:13,129
这是皮革材质。他们让你按压皮革来操作这个功能。
It's leather. They've got you pressing on leather to do this.

142
00:07:13,129 --> 00:07:16,360
所以这点非常有意思。
So that's very interesting.

143
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:18,808
然后中间这个音量旋钮是中性的。
And then the volume knob here in the middle is neutral.

